pe":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-08T21:28:57Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T21:28:57Z","body":"Yeah","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3629079993/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3629147813","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113726#issuecomment-3629147813","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113726","id":3629147813,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YUGal","user":{"login":"sockeye-d","id":106356149,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlbdtQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106356149?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d","html_url":"https://github.com/sockeye-d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-08T21:50:36Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T21:50:36Z","body":"Actually, I think this may be a race condition created by your use of WorkerThreadPool, and so it's not really a Godot issue.\n\nThe memory also just seems to grow unbounded until it reaches 5 GiB:\n\n<img width=\"2041\" height=\"509\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e90aa367-07fb-47e6-8dcc-aea6aca50fd2\" />\n\nat which point I see these errors:\n\n<img width=\"1354\" height=\"144\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2e9aca56-fbc4-4698-a671-02a7f3de97ac\" />\n\nYou'll need to stop modifying `chunkLibList` in your worker thread and in your main thread simultaneously without thread synchronization primitives like a `Mutex`. See [Thread-safe APIs](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/performance/thread_safe_apis.html) for more info, and especially this part:\n\n> ## GDScript arrays, dictionaries\n> In GDScript, reading and writing elements from multiple threads is OK, but anything that changes the container size (resizing, adding or removing elements) requires locking a mutex.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3629147813/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3629152717","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113726#issuecomment-3629152717","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113726","id":3629152717,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YUHnN","user":{"login":"Kevengg","id":74263421,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjYzNDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74263421?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevengg","html_url":"https://github.com/Kevengg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevengg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevengg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevengg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevengg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevengg/subscriptions","organizations_url